# Abloh's own bundle. These are compressed archives carried verbatim to a runner.
#
# A repository's root .gitattributes applies here too, and a rule such as `* text` or
# `* text=auto` rewrites line endings when a file is committed - which destroys the bytes of a
# .tgz and makes npm fail with Z_DATA_ERROR. This file takes precedence for the paths beneath it,
# so the repository's own rule stays exactly as its maintainer wrote it.
* binary
